root=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2];p=root/'outputs/MiCucumber_1_2pairs';th=list(csv.DictReader(open(root/'work/micucumber_1_2pairs/thermal/pair_thermodynamics.tsv'),delimiter='\t'));mx=max(float(v) for r in th for k,v in r.items() if k.endswith(('hairpin_max','homodimer_max','heterodimer_max')));assert mx<55,mx
shutil.copy2(root/'work/micucumber_1_2pairs/thermal/pair_thermodynamics.tsv',p/'thermodynamics.tsv');shutil.copy2(root/'outputs/MiCucumber/COPYRIGHT.md',p/'COPYRIGHT.md');j=json.load(open(p/'validation.json'));j.update(status='PASS',thermal_max_structure_C=mx,thermal_unique_pairs=len({r['name'] for r in th}));(p/'validation.json').write_text(json.dumps(j,indent=2))
r=[r for r in csv.DictReader(open(p/'comparison.csv')) if r['panel']=='common'];s='''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>MiCucumber：四版本各1对与2对</title><style>body{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 24px;font:16px/1.7 system-ui;color:#20333e}h1,h2{color:#087f8c}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px}th,td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left}th{background:#edf6f6}a{color:#087f8c}.note{background:#fff4db;padding:16px}</style><h1>四个长度版本，各保留1对与2对<br>Four regions × one- and two-pair portfolios</h1><p><strong>最终整理为8套计算候选。</strong>不再将3–4对或Apodida补充组列为默认方案；历史分析保留。各长度版本是替代选择，不要求同一样本全部运行。</p><p>Eight computational portfolios are retained. Regions are alternatives, not a requirement to run all assays per sample. Three-/four-pair portfolios and Apodida supplements are archived as comparisons.</p><p>主表采用共同面板151个名称标签/351个标签内单倍型；非Apodida指标以其中145个标签为分母。覆盖按名称标签等权、标签内单倍型等权计算。</p><table><tr><th>版本</th><th>对数</th><th>全部覆盖 %</th><th>全部完全匹配 %</th><th>非Apodida覆盖 %</th><th>非Apodida完全匹配 %</th><th>WC≤3 / GT≤2</th><th>WC≤4</th></tr>'''
for v in r:
 cells=[v['locus'].replace('MiCucumber-',''),v['count']]+[f"{float(v[k]):.2f}" for k in ['coverage_pct','exact_pct','non_Apodida_coverage_pct','non_Apodida_exact_pct']]+[v['WC_le3']+' / '+v['GT_le2'],v['WC_le4']];s+='<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+html.escape(x)+'</td>' for x in cells)+'</tr>'
s+='''</table><h2>如何使用这8套结果 / Interpretation</h2><p>v4opt两对版优先作为广覆盖短片段验证起点。单对版减少一次独立PCR，但完全匹配率更低。S/M/L的两对版均较各自单对版改善覆盖；它们仍不能视为同等通用性。尤其L两对版非Apodida覆盖仅约55%，保留为长片段比较，不作为通用检测方案。</p><p>Prioritize two-pair v4opt for broad-coverage validation. One-pair versions reduce reaction count. S/M/L remain length alternatives; low coverage, particularly for L, must remain visible rather than being treated as a universal assay.</p><h2>选择规则与验证 / Selection and verification</h2><p>沿用已完成穷举的1–2对候选组合，背景记录并集WC≤3与GT≤2分别不超过5；不为Apodida设置覆盖保底。每个对数先优化非Apodida覆盖，再在覆盖损失受限时提高完全匹配率。v4opt和M两对版采用最多2个百分点容差，其他采用1个百分点；均相对于同对数覆盖优先锚点、在共同及区域面板分别约束。全部预算/容差分析保留在上一轮结果中。最佳性仅限于已验证候选池，并非全序列设计空间。</p><p>All component sequences come from the previously independently scanned candidate pool. Exact and mismatch-tolerant per-record detections were checked again against the independent scanner. Both 50 nM per-variant and 200 nM per-direction split concentration scenarios passed the existing structural Tm screen. No held-out or wet-lab validation is claimed.</p><p class="note">“2对”指两套独立PCR结果并集，不是已经验证的单管混池。非目标数来自5,600条既有背景记录，不能解释为reads比例；WC≤4残余风险较高。漏检表区分完全与部分单倍型漏检；未被参考序列覆盖的物种不在分母内。</p><h2>序列与结果 / Files</h2><ul>'''
for name in ['v4opt','S','M','L']:s+=f'<li><a href="{name}_1_2pairs.csv">{name}：1对与2对序列 / Sequences</a></li>'
s+='''<li><a href="primer_pairs.csv">全部配对 / All pairs</a> · <a href="primers.fasta">FASTA</a></li><li><a href="comparison.csv">共同与区域面板 / Both panels</a> · <a href="missed_taxa.csv">漏检类群 / Missed taxa</a></li><li><a href="offtargets.csv">非目标明细 / Off-targets</a> · <a href="thermodynamics.tsv">热力学 / Thermodynamics</a> · <a href="validation.json">验证 / Validation</a></li><li><a href="MiCucumber_1_2pairs.zip">结果文件包 / Results bundle</a></li></ul><p>Copyright © 2026 Fei Xia (GUIBA-EX). All rights reserved. <a href="COPYRIGHT.md">Permissions</a>. Third-party data rights remain unaffected.</p></html>'''
